# SDD Generate — Code Generation from Specs

## Rules
1. Read the spec section by section
2. Generate ONE file per logical unit (entity, command, handler, test)
3. Follow the project's framework ({{framework}}) patterns
4. Use the project's validation library
5. Generate tests for ALL scenarios in the spec

## Code structure
```
src/domain/{domain}/entities/{entity}.ts
src/application/{feature}/command.ts
src/application/{feature}/handler.ts
tests/unit/{feature}/handler.test.ts
```

## Validation checklist
- [ ] Types match spec exactly
- [ ] All business rules implemented
- [ ] All error scenarios handled
- [ ] Tests cover happy path, alternatives, errors
- [ ] No extra functionality added
